edit_file needs either old_text (for an exact-match replace) or start_line+end_line (for a range replace). You provided `content` with neither.
If you want to REPLACE THE WHOLE FILE, use write_file instead:
  {"tool":"write_file","path":"README.md","content":"<full file contents>"}
If you want a PARTIAL edit, pick one of these two edit_file shapes:
  (a) exact-match:  {"tool":"edit_file","path":"README.md","old_text":"<substring present in file>","new_text":"<replacement>"}
  (b) line range:   {"tool":"edit_file","path":"README.md","start_line":<N>,"end_line":<M>,"content":"<replacement lines>"}
Do not re-submit the same call shape.
